{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "也可以在账本助手里点 ＋，从待导入收件箱选它来对账。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also tap + in the assistant and pick it from the import inbox to reconcile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单个文件最多 25MB": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each file can be up to 25 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单个账单文件最多 10MB": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each statement file can be up to 10 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发给账本助手": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send to Assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送 %lld 个文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Send %lld file"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Send %lld files"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图片%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Image %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存到待导入收件箱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save to Import Inbox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已保存 %lld 个账单文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Saved %lld statement file"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Saved %lld statement files"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已发给账本助手": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent to the assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待导入收件箱已满，请先在 Ledger 中核对或移除文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The import inbox is full. Review or remove files in Ledger first"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "想让账本助手做什么？（可选）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What should the assistant do? (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 Ledger，账本助手会在新对话里带上这些文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Ledger: the assistant starts a new conversation with these files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 CSV、Excel、PDF、邮件、HTML 和 ZIP 账单": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports CSV, Excel, PDF, email, HTML, and ZIP statements"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件将保存在 Ledger 的待导入收件箱。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file will be saved to Ledger's import inbox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法访问待导入收件箱，请稍后重试": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't access the import inbox. Try again later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能保存账单": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't save statement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未能发给账本助手": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't send to the assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在保存账单": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saving statement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在发给账本助手": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sending to the assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次请选择 1–5 个文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose 1–5 files at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次请选择 1–5 个账单文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose 1–5 statement files at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第 %lld 个文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "File %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该待导入文件已被移除，请重新分享": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This pending file was removed. Please share it again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请打开 Ledger，在「导入」的待导入收件箱中核对并提交。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Ledger and review and submit it from the import inbox under Import."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请选择有效的账单文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a valid statement file"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账单文件为空": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The statement file is empty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账本助手支持 CSV、Excel、PDF、HTML、文本和图片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The assistant reads CSV, Excel, PDF, HTML, text and images"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
